{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SJN8yQZkv22b3grwTWACHr","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Ramanujan â€” Implementation Plan (Foreman-ready) â€” v3 (post Stage-2 round 2)\n2\t\n3\ttest-command: node --test test/\n4\t\n5\t**North Star:** Ramanujan = a 6-pillar mathematical-reasoning PARTNER (Understand/Solve/Verify/Dialogue/Formalize/Contextualize) on ONE shared claim-ledger + verify-router spine, governed by THE HONESTY LAW (no same-family-authored object reaches a VERIFIED rung; the autonomous tier settles only literal finite computations bound to a re-executable out-of-model SUBPROCESS artifact; everything else ABSTAINS + routes to an out-of-model certifier). NS1â€“NS9.\n6\t\n7\t## Success criteria (and the Increment-1 acceptance boundary)\n8\tNS1 verified laddered comprehension Â· NS2 generative SOLVE + executable CONTROL Â· NS3 always-on independent VERIFY router by claim type + honest abstain Â· NS4 autoformalization faithfulness Â· NS5 honest per-claim rung+verifier-family stamp Â· NS6 stateful DIALOGUE that never asserts unverified math as settled Â· NS7 interactive FORMALIZE with the human gate Â· NS8 CONTEXTUALIZE composes researchPrime/Gandalf without reimplementing Â· NS9 THE HONESTY LAW (canaries + gradeable oracle).\n9\t\n10\t> **INCREMENT-1 ACCEPTANCE BOUNDARY (explicit).** This is the AUTONOMOUS increment (Phases Aâ€“E). **NS3-routing-lift, NS4-faithfulness, and NS7-human-gate are STRUCTURALLY UNVERIFIABLE here and realized ONLY as their honest abstain+route arm** (ABSTAIN to CONJECTURAL + advisory payload + route to the Increment-2 certifier). Their positive arm is the promotion-gated **Increment-2** (DESCRIPTION.md). Wave-27 project-DONE reads **\"NS abstain-arms DONE; NS3-lift/NS4/NS7 positive-arm = Increment-2\"** â€” NEVER \"NS1â€“9 satisfied\". The only positive VERIFIED lift Increment-1 demonstrates is the A4 literal-computation path (NS9/NS3-computational).\n11\t>\n12\t> Every wave ships real source